div.p:
On August 17 a meeting was held in the office of Mr. Gerig (UND) to discuss US
                    strategy in the General Assembly in dealing with a threatened Indian move to
                    have the GA recommend a cessation of nuclear tests in the Trust Territory of the
                    Pacific Islands pending an ICJ opinion on the legality of those tests.
                    Participating in the meeting were the following: 



L/UNA—Mr. Fensterwald, 

Mrs. Fleming;


L/FE—Miss Fite;

EUR—Mr. Allen;

ARA—Mr. Monsma;

UND—Mr. Gerig, 

Mr. Ross,

Mr. Withers;


UNP—Mr. Bechhoefer, 

Mr. Meyers;


NEA—Mr. Howard.
